 "fill_reason": {
  "pin_bound": "SRAM-face bound, not std area: the 8 ot_sram_1r1w_128x256 arrays carry 820 M4 pins each at 10 pins/um on their W/E faces (rd_out 256 + wd 137 on one face), which need 21.6 um pin-face halos plus std-cell channels on both sides of every stack; the denser 432x345.6 versions (s1/k1/k2, 33.6%) stalled in GRT inside the inter-macro gaps and k3 (27%) overflowed only at the aq0 gap/face. Tile faces carry 651-1261 pins (W/E up to ~4.3 pins/um)."
